{"ID":"20240504161428-httplvz","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161428-httplvz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161428-httplvz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161428-iy4bqjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607135842-0mrejvc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161428-iy4bqjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"091淮木","updated":"20240620130931"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504161428-iy4bqjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504161428-iy4bqjp","updated":"20240620130931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-qg1v0sm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-qg1v0sm"}},{"ID":"20240607135629-1a9jmzo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-1a9jmzo","updated":"20240607135634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-hjpz1s2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-hjpz1s2","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-ewdy7nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-ewdy7nb","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主久咳上气，肠中虚羸，女子阴蚀，漏下赤白沃。一名百岁城中木。生山谷（旧在《唐本草》中无毒，今增）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-krmmmjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-krmmmjk","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：淮木，神农雷公无毒，生晋平阳河东平泽，治久咳上气，伤中羸虚，补中益气（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-3lupdl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-3lupdl8","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名炭木，生太山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-b4shw4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-b4shw4k","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案李当之云：是樟树上寄生树，大衔枝在肌肉，今人皆以胡桃皮当之，非也；桐君云：生上洛，是木皮状如厚朴，色似桂白，其理一纵一横，今市人皆削乃以厚朴，而无正纵横理，不知此复是何物，莫测真假，何者为是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135629-qvlywe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135629-qvlywe7","updated":"20240607135629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上草，上品七十三种，旧七十二种，考六芝当为一，升麻当白字，米谷部误入青蘘，《唐本草》六种，姑活，屈草，淮木，皆当入此。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135630-yq2i6dj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135630-yq2i6dj"}},{"ID":"20240607135643-sph9gv6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135643-sph9gv6","updated":"20240607135652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135643-5nzoukl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135643-5nzoukl","updated":"20240607135643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主久咳上气，伤中虚羸，补中益气，女子阴蚀，漏下，赤白沃。一名百岁城中木。生晋阳平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135643-9mf73hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135643-9mf73hn","updated":"20240607135643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方∶药亦不复用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135644-awkn0mn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135644-awkn0mn"}},{"ID":"20240607135702-9d73o74","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135702-9d73o74","updated":"20240607135707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135702-vsgbof0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135702-vsgbof0","updated":"20240607135702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主久咳上气，伤中虚羸，补中益气，女子阴蚀漏下，赤白沃。一名百岁。城中木，生晋阳平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135702-cmgguvn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135702-cmgguvn"}},{"ID":"20240607135744-ce0m2yg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135744-ce0m2yg","updated":"20240607135755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135744-z5bhg9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135744-z5bhg9b","updated":"20240607135744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．补中益气．生晋阳．"}]},{"ID":"20240607135744-1uid6q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135744-1uid6q3","updated":"20240607135744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶淮木，味苦，平．主久咳上气，肠中虚羸，女子阴蚀漏下，赤白沃．一名百岁城中木．生平泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240607135744-lgqmgal","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135744-lgqmgal"}},{"ID":"20240607135804-czx624t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-czx624t","updated":"20240607135808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135804-9v10eos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-9v10eos","updated":"20240607135804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主久咳上气。肠中虚羸。女子阴蚀。漏下赤白沃。一名百岁城中木。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135804-5uwdp5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-5uwdp5b","updated":"20240607135804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"城中百岁。樟上长生。枝衔肌肉。理具纵横。云封索异。赤柱标名。似朴似桂。药味传精。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135804-8v1ghfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-8v1ghfb","updated":"20240607135804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李当之曰。是樟树上寄生。树大衔枝在肌肉。桐君曰。状如浓朴。色似桂白。其理一纵一横。名医曰。生太山。史记传。天子封太山。有白云起封中。于邵序。搜奇索异。李时珍曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135804-f66keca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-f66keca","updated":"20240607135804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名赤桂。后汉书。标名为证。陆龟蒙诗。僧传药味精。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135804-r1fxq8u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135804-r1fxq8u"}},{"ID":"20240607135811-no2shdt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135811-no2shdt","updated":"20240607135816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135811-5fkaby3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135811-5fkaby3","updated":"20240607135811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主治久咳上气，伤中，虚羸，补中益气，女子阴蚀。漏下，赤白沃。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135811-6ufw9hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135811-6ufw9hs","updated":"20240607135811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名百岁城中木。生晋阳平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135811-226kz25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135811-226kz25","updated":"20240607135811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药亦不复用。（《新修》三六五页，《大观》卷三○，《政和》五四六页）"}]},{"ID":"20240607135811-rgkuirr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135811-rgkuirr"}},{"ID":"20240607135831-sej5klc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135831-sej5klc","updated":"20240607135835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135831-q1331vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135831-q1331vk","updated":"20240607135831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十三"}]},{"ID":"20240607135831-es5q6gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135831-es5q6gs","updated":"20240607135831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神农、雷公∶无毒。生晋平阳、河东平泽。治久咳上气，伤中羸虚，补中益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135831-ffbz0ac","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135831-ffbz0ac"}},{"ID":"20240607135841-zl7pric","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135841-zl7pric","updated":"20240607135846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮木《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135841-ul2o26k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135841-ul2o26k","updated":"20240607135841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主久咳上气，伤中，虚羸，补中益气，女子阴蚀，漏下，赤白沃。一名百岁城中木。生晋阳平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135841-00ci16y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135841-00ci16y","updated":"20240607135841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药亦不复用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135841-9jdzvqc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135841-9jdzvqc"}},{"ID":"20240607135842-0mrejvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135842-0mrejvc"}}]}